      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-13T22:25:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was thinking the latter. And then along those lines, I was wondering if there was any real need for the board conversion function between charge port and charger IC.",
