      "writtenOn": "2020-04-14T19:42:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m good with forcing the board to put primary at the 0 index, since the assumption is documented in config.h. We could probably also get rid of the board conversion function?  Maybe add the port \u003d\u003d chgnum assumption to the OCPC comment block?",
